# 메모리: 터미널 2개에 각각 5만 줄을 출력한 뒤 앱·데몬 Private 메모리를 잰다
waittabs 1 @30000
wait 1500
mem start-1-terminal
key ctrl-shift-t
waittabs 2 @20000
wait 1500
mem start-2-terminals
sendto 1 seq 1 50000\r
send seq 1 50000\r
waitline 50000 @60000
wait 3000
mem after-50k-lines
key ctrl-left
waitline 50000 @20000
wait 1500
mem after-50k-lines-tab1
shot memory-final
quit
